[[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the vacuum pipe from the vacuum unit.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and remove the vacuum unit (2b) complete\nwith O-ring.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017816.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the complete vacuum unit complete with\na new O-ring and tighten the bolts to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Connector</p></td><td><p>PIPE FROM PUMP TO HYDRAULIC CONTROL UNIT</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.3 - 1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the vacuum pipe to the vacuum unit.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a></p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Loosen the band and disconnect the vacuum pipe from the vacuum\npump.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts (2a) and remove the vacuum unit (2b).</p><p>3. Remove the gasket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069936.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the vacuum unit (1a), complete with gasket (1b), back in\nits housing and secure it tightening the bolts (1c) to the recommended\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>BRAKE SERVO VACUUM PUMP</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side 05 06 50</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the vacuum intake pipe to the vacuum unit and tighten\nthe band.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069937.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]